      "text": "Vertical velocity is balanced (divergence == 0)\nbut horizontal is not - more is going in than out",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vertical velocity is balanced (divergence == 0)\nbut horizontal is not - more is going in than out",
